Package: countdown-machine
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Maintainer: Pablo Enoc <pablo@enocc.com>
Description: Count the days until a given date
 A small GTK app for Linux Mint that shows how many days are left
 until a date you choose, like Christmas or Thanksgiving.